00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:25.375
Please welcome the
legendary Fran Drescher.

00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:28.375
(audience applause)

00:10:32.431 --> 00:10:34.035
- Yes!

00:10:34.035 --> 00:10:37.875
- I'm so happy to be included
in this Queen of Queens game!

00:10:37.875 --> 00:10:40.187
- Oh god!
- I love you so much!

00:10:40.187 --> 00:10:45.187
(audience applause)
(upbeat music)

00:10:45.357 --> 00:10:50.160
(upbeat music)
(audience applause)

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.500
- We're back with the amazing, iconic,

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.740
and totally dope Awkwafina.

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:58.560
And in honor of "Nora
From Queens" and Awkwafina

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:00.020
