00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.230
Oh my, oh. Wow.

00:11:44.588 --> 00:11:46.307
- Hi, everyone!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.872
- I can't believe I'm here right now.

00:11:50.872 --> 00:11:52.360
(audience laughing)

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.990
- I love both you girls!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:57.453
I'm so happy to be included in
this "Queen of Queens" game.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.289
- I love you so you much!
- Oh God!

00:12:00.289 --> 00:12:02.676
I'm in like, I'm in a
"Queen of Queens" sandwich.

